WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.383 --> 00:00:06.763
Two sisters sit side by side, and only one hears Notch.

2
00:00:07.663 --> 00:00:08.663
What makes the difference?

3
00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:11.657
The answer began with a mutant fly.

4
00:00:12.557 --> 00:00:17.557
In 1989, Tadashi Uemura and colleagues studied embryos lacking the gene numb.

5
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.560
They worked in the laboratory of Lily and Yuh Nung Jan.

6
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:27.593
In these embryos, the sensory neurons were transformed into the support cells of the

7
00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:28.593
same lineage.

8
00:00:29.217 --> 00:00:30.677
They isolated the gene.

9
00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:33.797
That showed numb chooses between sister fates.

10
00:00:34.537 --> 00:00:35.637
But it did not show how.

11
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:42.900
In 1994, Michelle Rhyu, Lily Jan and Yuh Nung Jan stained dividing precursors with

12
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:43.900
an antibody to Numb.

13
00:00:44.933 --> 00:00:50.153
In this method, an antibody marks the protein, and a DNA dye shows the stage of

14
00:00:50.153 --> 00:00:51.153
mitosis.

15
00:00:51.717 --> 00:00:53.077
Numb was at the membrane.

16
00:00:53.997 --> 00:00:56.097
It lay in a crescent on one half of the cell.

17
00:00:57.067 --> 00:01:00.127
When the cell divided, Numb went into one daughter only.

18
00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:06.327
In the scheme they used, that daughter is the inner precursor.

19
00:01:07.347 --> 00:01:08.887
Its sister makes the hair and socket.

20
00:01:09.967 --> 00:01:15.127
Now two tests. First, remove numb from the precursor and its descendants.

21
00:01:15.127 --> 00:01:16.747
What cells form?

22
00:01:22.717 --> 00:01:25.737
Four outer support cells, and no neuron or sheath.

23
00:01:28.617 --> 00:01:33.137
Second, make extra Numb only during the precursor's division, so both daughters

24
00:01:33.137 --> 00:01:35.457
inherit it. What forms now?

25
00:01:41.417 --> 00:01:43.557
The change goes the opposite way.

26
00:01:44.277 --> 00:01:45.777
Both daughters take the inner branch.

27
00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:49.640
Each then divides as an inner precursor does.

28
00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:53.440
You get neurons and sheath cells, but no hair or socket.

29
00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:55.400
So there is no bristle.

30
00:01:58.433 --> 00:02:03.413
Opposite changes from loss and gain are strong evidence that a protein decides

31
00:02:03.413 --> 00:02:04.413
between two fates.

32
00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:07.497
Numb decides between the two branches.

33
00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.900
Now line this up with the Notch map.

34
00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.420
Numb goes into the inner precursor.

35
00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:16.600
That is the Notch-off daughter.

36
00:02:17.583 --> 00:02:19.763
So does Numb tell the cell what to become?

37
00:02:20.563 --> 00:02:22.683
Or does it only stop the cell from hearing Notch?

38
00:02:23.717 --> 00:02:28.217
Numb forms a crescent and goes into one daughter: the one that does not hear Notch.
